{"version":1,"content":"<p>面對全球關鍵礦物投資競爭加劇及供應鏈脆弱隱憂持續，澳洲資源部長馬德琳．金（Madeleine King）周二（27日）宣布，聯邦政府正全面修訂並更新國家的關鍵礦物戰略，將發展重心顯著轉向提煉（refining）與加工（processing）環節，以獲取更高的經濟效益與戰略價值，並減少對中國的依賴。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.635172+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:42:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:20.116329+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.128820+00:00","content_hash":"6703d907164070fcdd81d3608f79816f33ae90c93713c0b29e68ff0e7d231331","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}